WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.531
<v><b>A:</b></v> ‘<b> I love you</b>.’

00:00:02.594 --> 00:00:04.261
<v><b>B:</b></v> He said (that) <b>he loved me</b>.

00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:07.525
<v><b>A:</b></v> ‘<b> I’ve just arrived</b>.’

00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:10.786
<v><b>B:</b></v> She said (that) <b>she had just arrived</b>.

00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:13.980
<v><b>A:</b></v> ‘<b> We’ll come</b> at eight.’

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:17.484
<v><b>B:</b></v> He told me (that) <b>they would come</b> at eight.

00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:21.325
<v><b>A:</b></v> ‘<b> I don’t want</b> to go to the party.’

00:00:22.491 --> 00:00:25.999
<v><b>B:</b></v> Jack told Anna (that) <b>he didn’t want</b> to go to the party.